{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深水埗運動場有地盤發現兩枚懷疑戰時炸彈，事件中無人受傷。</p><p></p><p>身穿保護裝備的爆炸品處理課人員，到場處理，之後將炸彈檢走，再由警車運走。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BOMB-2100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KZ8d1QmAPE1795793021.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方傍晚6時接獲工人報案，指深水埗運動場內一個籃球場地盤，發現兩枚懷疑二戰時期的美製燃燒式子彈，分別長約15厘米和17厘米。</p><p></p><p>附近約15米範圍需要封鎖，包括足球場內的使用人士，一度要疏散。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BOMB-2100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OHR9jKjxfk1795793036.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:04:08.898448+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T15:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:11.878740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:57:16.433779+00:00","content_hash":"f0b5d8efe300a983819dbece098d81b5437fdc350fef35a529b8beb13e7a08de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}